<title>THAILAND: Thai govt seeks 10,000T rubber for May shipment.</title>
<headline>Thai govt seeks 10,000T rubber for May shipment.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai government entered the market again this week to seek 10,000 tonnes of RSS3 rubber for May shipment, a rubber auction official said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
